    "chunk_text": "ytlan suna. Se gehyrde his stefne & acsode, hw\u00e6t se biscop him dyde, & hine la\u00f0ode, \u00fe\u00e6t he s\u00e6te mid him in & he \u00fea swa dyde. \u00dea spr\u00e6con hi heom betwux wel fela worda, o\u00f0 \u00e6t nexstan se ylca awyrgda gast gefor in \u00feone & he \u00fea sona se earma man swa astyped & swa bereafod his suna ong\u00e6t hra\u00f0e, hw\u00e6ne he sylfa Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: hw\u00e6t cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 we la, hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t sy, \u00fe\u00e6t se ealda feond onfeng swylcere bylde to Gregorius him andswarode: fela \u00feinga, Petrus, beo\u00f0 gode gesewene, ac hi ne beo\u00f0 na gode, for\u00feon Be \u00fean seo so\u00f0f\u00e6stnys cw\u00e6\u00fe on his godspelle: gif \u00fein eaga by\u00f0 manfull, \u00feonne by\u00f0 \u00fein lichama For\u00feon \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t inge\u00feanc \u00fe\u00e6s mannes by\u00f0 woh & forcyrred, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r foregange\u00fe, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t For\u00feon ne wene ic na, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees wer w\u00e6re mid arf\u00e6stnysse mode gelustfullod, ac mid t\u00e6lnysse Se \u00fee his suna bereafod w\u00e6s, se ongan swilce he for Godes lufan gestli\u00fenysse gegearwode. So\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fterfylgende wite \u00fe\u00e6r cy\u00fe\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t seo \u00e6rre feormung n\u00e6s na butan scylde & gylte. Eac swylce manige men syndon, \u00fee for\u00feon tilia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hi god don, \u00fee hi willa\u00f0 gedwellan \u00fea gife Ne hi na for\u00feon o\u00fere m\u00e6n feormia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hi mycc",
